#: ../../source/guide/advanced_structures/hash_table.rst:14
#: 0068dfd57ae94c5e90fff5e037de5389
msgid ""
"A **hash table** maps keys to values via a hash function. SDS-Tools "
"provides two implementations with different collision-resolution "
"strategies, both sharing the "
":class:`~sds.advanced.interfaces.AbstractHashTable` interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/advanced_structures/hash_table.rst:19
