#: e022f491abdb4027b26e072620821a6c
msgid ""
"All entries reside in the primary array. On collision, the algorithm "
"probes successive slots ``(h + 1) % m``, ``(h + 2) % m``, etc. Deleted "
"slots are marked with a **tombstone** (``_DELETED``) to preserve probing "
"chains."
